URL to project video: https://drive.google.com/file/d/18nLNjKqtk7zCOaOm1eBZ30gXdrCi3Y7k/view?usp=sharing

All the code are our code, while index.html shows the vertical scrolling version of our website (with a few visualizations missing) and comic.html shows the latest and final version of our website. For the code to work you need to put the data folder into the code folder.

Non-obvious features of the roadtype visualization: the legends can be toggled on and off.